  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 28f310e05cc019a48855581da30b411e, type: 3}
  m_Name: BicolHistory
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - text: 'Spicy, creamy, and named after a train. Bicol Express earns its heat honestly, '
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "with \u201Csiling labuyo\u201D and \u201Csiling haba\u201D bringing fire
      while \u201Cgata\u201D and \u201Cbagoong alamang\u201D bring comfort. "
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The story. A Manila cook in the 1970s renamed an older Bicolano chili-and
      coconut tradition,
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - text: after the overnight train that carried travelers between Manila and Legazpi.
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Can you balance the heat with the richness,
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "without ever breaking the delicate \r\ncoconut cream?"
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
